{"id":"uspekh","lemma":"успех","pos":"noun","rank":1471,"glosses":["success, progress"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e3/Ru-%D1%83%D1%81%D0%BF%D0%B5%D1%85.ogg/Ru-%D1%83%D1%81%D0%BF%D0%B5%D1%85.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"успехи"},"examples":[{"text":"Это был полный успех.","en":"It was a complete success.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"full, complete"},null]},{"text":"Ты всё ещё делаешь успехи?","en":"Are you still making progress?","words":[{"g":"you"},null,null,{"g":"to make, to do","l":"делать"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"still, yet, as yet"]]},{"text":"Вы, кажется, делаете успехи.","en":"You seem to be making progress.","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"apparently, it seems"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"делать"},null]},{"text":"Он надеялся на успех.","en":"He hoped to succeed.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to hope","l":"надеяться"},{"g":"on / at"},null]},{"text":"Его успех вызывает вопросы.","en":"His success is in question.","words":[{"g":"him / his"},null,{"g":"to call, to send for","l":"вызывать"},{"g":"question","l":"вопрос"}]}]}